The data in this repository - the structures and label tables in
A_elasticity/data and B_permeability/data, the precomputed descriptor tables
and reference results in A_elasticity/reference and B_permeability/reference,
and the images in A_elasticity/figures and B_permeability/figures - are
licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License
(CC BY 4.0), https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/.

The structures and labels are subsets of the datasets published with

  R. Topolnicki, M. Bogdan, J. Malinowski, B. Naskrecki, M. Haranczyk, P. Dlotko,
  "Direction-aware topological descriptors for elastic stiffness tensor
  prediction in porous materials", arXiv:2604.08105
  https://github.com/dioscuri-tda/direction-aware-tda-for-porous-materials

  R. Topolnicki, P. Dlotko, M. Matyka,
  "Permeability tensor of anisotropic porous media from directional
  pore-space topology"
  https://github.com/dioscuri-tda/perm-tensor-topology

Please cite the corresponding paper when using them.
